  "details": "There are many cases in which an avatar makes it difficult or impossible see your menu in order to leave the avatar. It would be really helpful if safe mode would hide your own avatar (perhaps locally applying one of the grey robots) for these cases.\n\nThis would be useful for avatars that are too small, or have parts that clip with your vision, or have a shader or other effect that makes it impossible to see the menu to change out.",
